    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mega City Parkour is all about exploring a massive Cyberpunk / Sci-Fi city of the future. There is no score, no killing, no quests \u2013 only fun exploration.<br><br>The detailed center of the city is a little more than 1km2. The surrounding suburbs and industrial areas add an additional 10km2 of explorable area. The city is 100% open and ready to explore immediately. <br><br>The player has full control over the weather with 13 weather conditions, as well as the time of day.<br><br>You can explore the city with a car, a flying hover-car, ziplines, rope swings, and of course parkour. The parkour abilities include 24 styles of vaulting, mantling, climbing, sliding and, more. <br><br>The game requires a good PC to run. With a PC equipped with an RTX-4080 GPU I achieve 50 FPS at 4K resolution on \u201chigh\u201d graphics settings, and on a laptop equipped with an RTX-1650Ti GPU I achieve 50 FPS at 1080p resolution on \u201cmedium\u201d graphics settings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The game has instructions in English, Chinese, Japanese, Korean, Spanish, Portuguese, German, French, and Russian.</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mega City Parkour is all about exploring a massive Cyberpunk / Sci-Fi city of the future. There is no score, no killing, no quests \u2013 only fun exploration.<br><br>The detailed center of the city is a little more than 1km2. The surrounding suburbs and industrial areas add an additional 10km2 of explorable area. The city is 100% open and ready to explore immediately. <br><br>The player has full control over the weather with 13 weather conditions, as well as the time of day.<br><br>You can explore the city with a car, a flying hover-car, ziplines, rope swings, and of course parkour. The parkour abilities include 24 styles of vaulting, mantling, climbing, sliding and, more. <br><br>The game requires a good PC to run. With a PC equipped with an RTX-4080 GPU I achieve 50 FPS at 4K resolution on \u201chigh\u201d graphics settings, and on a laptop equipped with an RTX-1650Ti GPU I achieve 50 FPS at 1080p resolution on \u201cmedium\u201d graphics settings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The game has instructions in English, Chinese, Japanese, Korean, Spanish, Portuguese, German, French, and Russian.</strong></p>",
